      "content": "If you hypothesize that the noise represents a modulated carrier signal, probing for structured mathematics is the logical next step. Testing for sequences like prime number spacing or Fibonacci ratios within the timing or phase of the pitch deviations could reveal intentional structuring. You might also examine the deviations for repeating burst patterns or specific entropy levels to look for encoding schemes. This methodical search for non-random mathematical syntax is how hidden protocols are typically uncovered.",
